        "\n",
        "The duplicate-record check identified zero duplicate rows, indicating that every complete record is unique. The dataset contains 21 integer columns, 1 floating-point column, and 11 object columns. The `appointment_date` column is currently stored as an object and should later be converted into a date format during data preprocessing.\n",
        "\n",
        "The selected target variable, `disease_risk_level`, contains three classes: Low, Medium, and High. The class distribution is not fully balanced because the Low-risk category has fewer records than the Medium- and High-risk categories. This imbalance should be considered during model training and evaluation."
