      "source": [
        "## 3.9 Data Cleaning Justification\n",
        "\n",
        "The `appointment_date` attribute was converted from the object data type to the datetime data type. This conversion allows date components such as year, month, and day of the week to be extracted accurately during feature engineering. The conversion process did not identify any invalid or missing appointment dates.\n",
        "\n",
        "Leading and trailing spaces were removed from all categorical values to maintain consistent category labels. This prevents values with accidental spaces from being interpreted as separate categories during feature encoding. These cleaning operations improve data consistency without changing the original meaning of the values."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "mi2d_3wKFPg_"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 3.10 Identify Outliers Using the IQR Method"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "mosFVtYSFkc2"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "clinical_numerical_columns = [\n",
        "    'age',\n",
        "    'systolic_bp',\n",
        "    'diastolic_bp',\n",
        "    'blood_sugar_mg_dl',\n",
        "    'cholesterol_mg_dl',\n",
        "    'bmi'\n",
        "]\n",
        "\n",
        "outlier_summary = []\n",
        "\n",
        "for column in clinical_numerical_columns:\n",
        "    q1 = df_processed[column].quantile(0.25)\n",
        "    q3 = df_processed[column].quantile(0.75)\n",
        "    iqr = q3 - q1\n",
        "\n",
        "    lower_bound = q1 - (1.5 * iqr)\n",
        "    upper_bound = q3 + (1.5 * iqr)\n",
        "\n",
        "    outlier_count = (\n",
        "        (df_processed[column] < lower_bound) |\n",
        "        (df_processed[column] > upper_bound)\n",
        "    ).sum()\n",
        "\n",
        "    outlier_summary.append({\n",
        "        'Attribute': column,\n",
        "        'Lower Bound': round(lower_bound, 2),\n",
        "        'Upper Bound': round(upper_bound, 2),\n",
        "        'Outlier Count': outlier_count\n",
        "    })\n",
        "\n",
        "outlier_summary_df = pd.DataFrame(outlier_summary)\n",
        "outlier_summary_df"
      ],
